  "reasoning": "The defendant sold large quantities of pirated optical discs without the copyright holder's permission, for profit. This constitutes illegal reproduction and distribution of copyrighted works, which under Chinese criminal law is the crime of infringement of copyright (侵犯著作权罪). No other crimes are indicated in the facts.",
